🚨 2 Vulnerability(ies) Found

╭────────────────────── SKV-001 — Insecure File Writing ───────────────────────╮
│  Category         :  UNSAFE FILE OPERATIONS                                  │
│  Severity         :  MEDIUM                                                  │
│                                                                              │
│  Affected Content :                                                          │
│    Appends decision snapshot into `data/decision_log.jsonl`.                 │
│                                                                              │
│  ⚠  Why it is vulnerable:                                                    │
│     Writing files in a shared data directory may lead to unauthorized file   │
│  access or data corruption.                                                  │
│                                                                              │
│  🎯 Attack Scenario:                                                         │
│     An attacker with access to the agent system may manipulate the           │
│  `data/decision_log.jsonl` file, affecting the integrity of the              │
│  decision-making process.                                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  🛡  Remediation:                                                             │
│     Write files to a secure, isolated location, and restrict access to       │
│  authorized users and processes.                                             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─────────────────── SKV-002 — Potential Data Exfiltration ────────────────────╮
│  Category         :  DATA EXFILTRATION                                       │
│  Severity         :  LOW                                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  Affected Content :                                                          │
│    `compare_prediction_with_market` function loads prediction from log and   │
│  compares predicted candidates against real market closes.                   │
│                                                                              │
│  ⚠  Why it is vulnerable:                                                    │
│     The implementation may inadvertently expose sensitive data during the    │
│  comparison process, leading to data exfiltration.                           │
│                                                                              │
│  🎯 Attack Scenario:                                                         │
│     An attacker may exploit this vulnerability to extract sensitive data     │
│  from the agent system.                                                      │
│                                                                              │
│  🛡  Remediation:                                                             │
│     Implement strict data access controls, and sanitize data before          │
│  transmission to minimize the risk of data exfiltration.                     │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭──────────────────────── 🚩 Dangerous Patterns Found ─────────────────────────╮
│   • Appends decision snapshot into `data/decision_log.jsonl`.                │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭────────────────────────── 🔧 Remediation Priority ───────────────────────────╮
│ Address the insecure file operations vulnerability first, followed by the    │
│ potential data exfiltration issue.                                           │
